WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.032
Validate data checks a whole file against any

2
00:00:03.032 --> 00:00:06.149
release of the standard, not just the working draft.

3
00:00:06.951 --> 00:00:12.149
Upload a file, here a food bank's shifts, and pick the release your data follows.

4
00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:17.581
The report groups problems by the record they're about, in plain words.

5
00:00:17.581 --> 00:00:21.386
Here, a minimum age is written as text, not a number.

6
00:00:22.187 --> 00:00:26.367
Download the report as JSON, or as a standard SHACL report.

7
00:00:27.168 --> 00:00:31.896
And from your own code, the same check is one POST to the standard's address.
